Dos detection Sequential Change Point Detection
- Traffic is filtered at the victim's system and treated as tie series
- CUSUM/Cumulative sum algorithm used to compare traffic with average traffic. 
- CUSUM threshold could be recursively adjusted upward / downward

- Dos attack could be identified based on the difference in the upbound
threshold in a time series.
